; Several currencies. Activity and amounts count in the budget's commodity, converted at their own date with the
; ledger's prices: the latest on or before the date, the last of a day winning; the pair itself, else its inverse,
; else through the cost currency of a posting held at cost. An amount no price converts at its date is left out and
; reported as BudgetCommodityMismatch where it is written; a zero amount needs no price. The transactions are in an
; included file.
option "operating_currency" "CNY"
option "timezone" "Europe/Berlin"

1970-01-01 commodity CNY
1970-01-01 commodity USD
1970-01-01 commodity EUR
1970-01-01 commodity JPY
1970-01-01 commodity GBP
1970-01-01 commodity AAPL

2024-01-01 open Assets:Bank
2024-01-01 open Assets:Broker
2024-01-01 open Expenses:Travel
  budget: Travel
2024-01-01 open Expenses:Gifts
  budget: Travel
2024-01-01 open Expenses:Abroad
  budget: Dollars

2024-01-01 budget Travel CNY
2024-01-01 budget Dollars USD

; USD in CNY, changing within the month
2024-01-01 price USD 7.10 CNY
2024-01-15 price USD 7.20 CNY
2024-01-15 price USD 7.25 CNY
2024-01-20 18:00:00 price USD 7.30 CNY
; EUR only quoted the other way round: CNY in EUR
2024-01-01 price CNY 0.125 EUR
; JPY only from February on
2024-02-01 price JPY 0.05 CNY
; AAPL only in USD
2024-01-01 price AAPL 150 USD

2024-01-01 budget-add Travel 10000 CNY
2024-01-02 budget-add Travel 100 USD
2024-01-02 budget-add Dollars 1000 CNY
2024-01-03 budget-add Travel 10000 JPY
2024-01-04 budget-add Travel 0 GBP
2024-01-05 budget-transfer Travel Dollars 50 USD

include "2024/01.zhang"
